{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"733827832635195424","content":"(I wrote this scene out in a Google doc. It's wall of text time lol)","created_at":"2020-08-20T17:41:02.007000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746061245215539300","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"733827832635195424","content":"Leaf returns to the hatch, a solemn look on her face. She carefully picks up the mechanical hummingbird she left behind and holds it up, allowing it to flutter around. She sits down in the grass next to the metal hatch and taps it. The hummingbird hovers over the spot at eye level and looks to her expectantly. She looks around the area for a moment and sighs. The hatch is closed but she assumes Ebuc has ways of hearing her anyway.","created_at":"2020-08-20T17:41:47.757000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746061437104947280","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"733827832635195424","content":"\"This is more of what I had in mind when I said I wanted to talk to you last night. The being outside part I mean. Literally nothing else is how I thought it'd be. I don't know what I expected. I could feel your hatred back at the crash, and I noticed you wouldn't reply back in goblin, but I just thought somehow...\" she sighs and shakes her head .","created_at":"2020-08-20T17:42:15.817000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746061554796986398","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"733827832635195424","content":"\"I guess this version of you would consider that an imperfection of mine? That I look for the best in people? I really did believe for a second there that you'd let me talk to you. I wanted to tell you what I told Rock. Though I guess you might have heard it already. Well, either way, what I said hasn't changed all that much. I still hope you find peace. And by peace, I mean a day when you'll be happy with yourself and how the world is. No metal factory. No Golden Dawn. Just you. Existing. Maybe even being happy. How long has it been since you've been truly happy?\" Leaf pauses, as if expecting an answer. An old trick from talking to silent trees for many years.","created_at":"2020-08-20T17:42:51.203000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746061703216758917","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"733827832635195424","content":"\"When I was back on the sub, I didn't ask you outright about if you were in the Dawn. I was scared. Not much point in being scared now, huh? So I'll be more straightforward this time. I don't believe there are simply good or evil people in the world. It's what we do with our time here that defines us. Some people use their time to build with love, and others use hate. A good person can still do things out of hate, same as a bad person out of love. Rockman for example. He's all love.\" She smiles \"Even if that's not what you intended. You put the best parts of yourself in him, which somehow included loving me. Thanks for that.\" Leaf chuckles.","created_at":"2020-08-20T17:44:39.240000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746062156356780102","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"733827832635195424","content":"\"But Ebuc, this part of you is doing things out of hate. All you're doing is pumping more hurt into the world. That's what I intend to fix. The hurt in the world. Small actions at a time. Speaking of which, you're the one with the memories, so you know what I mean. That also means you've been given a tool to fix this. Even a small part of you has to be able to remember the love these people had for you. Why do you think they're so upset about this? It also means you still know me. You know what I would want you to do.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T17:45:40.728000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746062414256013424","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"733827832635195424","content":"She stands and cups her hand, the hummingbird moves to hover above it, whizzing softly in front of her face. \"So long as you have breath in your lungs, build others with these tools: Hope, faith and love.\" She nods to the hummingbird. It bows like his old one used to before fluttering off into the woods. \"Find your peace.\" She watches it leave before turning on her heels in a spin and final bow, arm across her chest. She laughs at the irony and skips back to town.","created_at":"2020-08-20T17:46:40.037000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746062663015989320","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"733827832635195424","content":"As she does so, she sings softly to herself,\n\n*Hey, it's the end of the world, now, haven't you heard, so*\n*Smoke em if you got em, boys and girls*\n***Say goodbye to the past,*** *now, raise up your glass and*\n*Revel while it lasts, it's the end of the world*","created_at":"2020-08-20T17:47:35.557000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-20T17:48:08.270000Z","id":"746062895884009532","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
